  m_text: '<size=16>

    Comes in 3 colors: Purple, Red, and Green, matching each
    feature above the reels.

    Appears on all reels and lands with one of the
    following prizes: Credit, Mini, Minor, Major, and Mega.

    Once landed, contributes
    to the respective feature and may randomly trigger Firecracker Bonus.

    </size>'
