  m_text: '<size=16>

    Once triggered, awards 5 Free Spins.

    Only Cash, Free
    Spin, and Super Cash symbols appear during the Super Spin Bonus.

    Free Spin
    Symbol awards extra spins, once landed.

    All landed Cash and Super Cash symbols
    gets locked.

    Once Super Cash Symbol lands, it collects and locks on it ALL
    credits from Cash Symbols on the same reelset, EXCEPT Jackpots and other Super
    Cash Symbols.

    Cover all 15 spots on 1 of reelsets with Cash Symbols to win
    GRAND.

    </size>'
