    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=16>

    Once triggered, adds 1 extra 3x5 reelset, copying and locking
    on it all triggering Cash Symbols from the initial reelset.

    Awards 5 Free
    Spins to each of reelsets.

    Only Cash and Free Spin Symbol appear during
    the Double Spins Bonus.

    Free Spin Symbol awards extra spins, once landed.

    All
    landed Cash Symbols gets locked.

    Cover all 15 spots on 1 of reelsets with
    Cash Symbols to win GRAND.

    Only in Double Spin Bonus, GRAND can be won TWICE.

    </size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5316d286fa94a894888ee12767189de0, type: 2}
